{"3989570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Death in a Party - ACT I", "steam_appid": 3989570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't believe it's still there. The remains of Mannyland. That 90's theme park based on the popular character franchise 'Manny and Friends'. Somehow, knowing this fills you with a sinking feeling. The call of unresolved memories pull you back... And now you have the key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPLORE and DISCOVER this psychological horror comedy inspired by janky point and click games of days gone by, the works of David Lynch and Toby Fox, plus a certain pink yellow blob-themed British pop-culture character. Imagine if that house party never ended... It continued, in secret, with what we weren't supposed to see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are no monsters here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only people.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 hand-drawn 2D backgrounds, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Environments with a hand-drawn style,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things to click on,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >0% monster chase scenes!!,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reluctant jump scares,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pain and Suffering :(</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AAA Game (There's three A's in the title),</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly specific humour based on 1990's British life, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features the <i>Toxic Best Friend Simulator</i>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by one person!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't believe it's still there. The remains of Mannyland. That 90's theme park based on the popular character franchise 'Manny and Friends'. Somehow, knowing this fills you with a sinking feeling. The call of unresolved memories pull you back... And now you have the key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPLORE and DISCOVER this psychological horror comedy inspired by janky point and click games of days gone by, the works of David Lynch and Toby Fox, plus a certain pink yellow blob-themed British pop-culture character. Imagine if that house party never ended... It continued, in secret, with what we weren't supposed to see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are no monsters here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only people.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 hand-drawn 2D backgrounds, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Environments with a hand-drawn style,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things to click on,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >0% monster chase scenes!!,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reluctant jump scares,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pain and Suffering :(</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AAA Game (There's three A's in the title),</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly specific humour based on 1990's British life, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features the <i>Toxic Best Friend Simulator</i>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by one person!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "You begin in a theme park forgotten to the world for over a decade. What you uncover will take you further down, below the surface, to man-made horrors you can comprehend. Point and click horror game about nostalgia.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989570/20dc1173d2f712f53707368a8c8969a0ae28eab3/header.jpg?t=1763238354", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets